ENDA

GuildhallSkyMenuEvent:
CallMenu(RecruitSkyMenu)
SVAL 0x1 0
BNE 0x2000 0xc 0x1
CALL GuildhallLoadSkyKnights
GOTO 0x2008
LABEL 0x2000
SVAL 0x1 1
BNE 0x2001 0xc 0x1
CALL GuildhallLoadScaleKnights
LABEL 0x2001
GOTO 0x2008
LABEL 0x2003
SystemText(ErrorHandlerText)
LABEL 0x2008
ENDA